              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kori apaki daadaŋ ŋina eyakaunor ekile aŋayaŋayat, totamanak aberu keŋ ŋakiro atemar kori elomit. Eyaari nai iŋes aberu keŋ kiŋaren Ekapolon, kitiya nai esacaradoti ŋakiro ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.30",
